2. Data Types :

int         4bytes       int a = 4;
long        8bytes       long y = 100L;
double      8bytes       double d = 3.14;
float       4bytes       float  a = 1.5f; 
char        2bytes       char a = 'a';
boolean     1bit         boolean b = true;
string      varies       string s = 'abc';

