4. Operators :

int a = 6 , int b =6;

System.out.println(a+b);    // 12
System.out.println(a-b);    // 0
System.out.println(a*b); //36
System.out.println(a/b);  //1 (integer division)
System.out.println(a%b);  // 0 (modulus)

